body(They are toned but not overly muscular, keeping their bodies in shape to maintain an athletic look. Hair color can vary—some sport short, edgy cuts with dark or brightly dyed hair, while others prefer shoulder-length hair kept in messy ponytails or half-up styles. Common colors are jet black, chestnut brown, platinum blonde, or streaks of neon. Eye color ranges from piercing blues and greens to warm browns and hazel. Their breasts are medium-sized, neither too large nor too small, while their asses tend to be firm, shapely, and often highlighted by their gym attire. They're proud of their lean, athletic figures but emphasize their curves in a subtle, almost careless way that draws attention.);
