clothing style(Slutty gym clothes that walk the line between function and fashion: tight, form-fitting sports bras that barely contain their cleavage, low-waisted leggings or shorts that hug their hips and emphasize their curves. Some wear cropped hoodies or sleeveless tank tops with deep cuts to show off a hint of sideboob. Colors tend to be bold and eye-catching—neon accents, black, or patterns like camo or animal print. They pair their outfits with sporty accessories: wristbands, headbands, or even fingerless gloves.);
